Rāma Sītā Lakṣmaṇa circumambulate grieving king --- Lakṣmaṇa takes Kausalyā and Sumitrā leave --- Sumitrā bids Lakṣmaṇa serve Rāma as refuge --- Sumantra brings sun-like chariot for exiles --- Sītā mounts chariot with brothers weapons aboard --- Citizens chase chariot begging slow horses --- Citizens praise Sītā shadow-faith and Lakṣmaṇa service --- Daśaratha stumbles out to see dear son --- Rāma orders charioteer fast past weeping parents --- Ministers halt tearful king gazing after son
